{
  "name": "Shuffll Engage - Review campaign readiness and video results",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "2c37d2ea-cfd7-4189-95bb-d4d9286e7d16",
      "name": "Setup and limitations",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review an existing video campaign\n\nConfigure a private **Templated Custom Auth** credential on every HTTP node. Template: `{\"headers\":{\"Authorization\":\"Bearer {{api_key}}\"}}`. Store your workspace-scoped key only in the credential secret field. A paid Shuffll subscription and enabled API access are required.\n\nSet `campaignId` to an accessible campaign UUID. Requires `campaigns:read` and `results:read`. Read-only: no generation or sending. Inspect each node output; readiness and render results are different. Lists up to 50 results; continue with the returned `nextCursor` as a `cursor` query parameter. Returned URLs can be private media links: share them only with authorized recipients. Rendered media does not establish message delivery or engagement.",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6e605652-209d-4fc9-825a-294d80029e0a",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "313c5f93-195c-4204-84cc-28068f6a5c0f",
      "name": "Campaign inputs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "d43596ed-4c48-4f14-a577-2c75658908e7",
              "name": "campaignId",
              "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CAMPAIGN_UUID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d2c48c6b-3655-4413-962f-b0cca6e2e7d2",
      "name": "Check campaign readiness",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ 'https://engage.shuffll.com/api/v1/campaigns/' + encodeURIComponent($('Campaign inputs').first().json.campaignId) + '/validate' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpTemplatedCustomAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": false
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e03c8da3-83a5-437f-8787-282ef83b71c2",
      "name": "Read video results - first page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ 'https://engage.shuffll.com/api/v1/campaigns/' + encodeURIComponent($('Campaign inputs').first().json.campaignId) + '/results' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpTemplatedCustomAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "redirect": {
            "redirect": {
              "followRedirects": false
            }
          },
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
